  "scope": "Repeated-class-partition exploratory robustness study on the same 100 CUB species. Three predeclared class partition seeds; each 50 seen/25 development-unseen/25 final-unseen. Fresh probe, train-only attribute vocabulary, and fusion for every partition/backbone. One fusion seed per partition, five matched variants, two learning rates. Shared 2500-photo catalog includes 750 additional images; each run uses 1750. Image encodings may be precomputed, but final classification metrics are not calculated until all six model/partition selections are locked. Prior 100-class results were inspected; this is not independent confirmation. SigLIP text is explicitly lowercased. No privileged profiles/crops."
}